<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Frost Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the frost sphere freeze: the sorcerers' snowballs, frostballs, ice storms and blizzards. Most of them bite hardest through clothes and less through plate. The sphere is a category of spells: it can't be practised, but rises by itself to half your best frost spell. How hard a frost spell bites depends on your magic and your skill in that spell. The sphere counts when you resist: against a frost spell cast at you, you defend with your brain and the better of half your skill in that spell or your frost sphere (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). To resist cold better, see <a cmd='#'>Help Cold Resistance</a>; dragons may also breathe frost (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>frost breath   no guild teaches it
blizzard       sorcerer 70 (up to 90%)
snowball       sorcerer 6
frostball      sorcerer 19
iceball        sorcerer 100
icestorm       sorcerer 34
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
